-- P6 — THE DOUBLE-ENTRY LEDGER AND REFUNDS (specification 14, 17, 48)
--
-- Generated by drizzle-kit, then REVIEWED AND EDITED BY HAND. Four statements
-- were removed, along with a CREATE TABLE for payment_method_secrets, because
-- they re-proposed work that migrations 0013 and 0020
-- already did by hand — Drizzle does not read hand-written migrations, so it
